## Status: `root-heads` is a scaffold

`RootHeadsPlugin` references `HeadDeathListener`, `HeadItemFactory`, `HeadDropService`, and `HeadsCommand`, but those classes **do not exist yet**. Patterns below come from root-heads config + sibling root-* plugins.

---

### 1. `RootRecordYamlConfig` (load, reload, typed getters, nested maps)

**Loader:** `D:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\Plugin Building\Minecraft\plugins\rootrecord-common\src\main\java\com\rootrecord\minecraft\common\config\RootRecordYamlConfig.java`

```45:60:D:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\Plugin Building\Minecraft\plugins\rootrecord-common\src\main\java\com\rootrecord\minecraft\common\config\RootRecordYamlConfig.java
    public void load() {
        RootRecordFolders.ensureDir(plugin);
        File file = file();
        if (!file.isFile()) {
            copyDefaultFromJar(file);
        }
        configuration = YamlConfiguration.loadConfiguration(file);
        if (mergeMissingFromJar()) {
            save();
        }
    }

    public void reload() {
        configuration = null;
        load();
    }
```

