### 3. Head items — `SkullMeta`, PDC, custom textures

**No `PlayerProfile` / base64 texture implementation exists in this repo.**  
`root-heads.yml` defines `texture:` for `PLAYER_HEAD` mobs (enderman, blaze), but `HeadItemFactory` is missing.

**Player skull (owner-based, not custom texture):**  
`D:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\Plugin Building\Minecraft\plugins\root-admin\src\main\java\com\rootrecord\minecraft\rootadmin\command\AdminCommands.java`

```356:359:D:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\Plugin Building\Minecraft\plugins\root-admin\src\main\java\com\rootrecord\minecraft\rootadmin\command\AdminCommands.java
            ItemStack skull = new ItemStack(Material.PLAYER_HEAD);
            SkullMeta meta = (SkullMeta) skull.getItemMeta();
            meta.setOwningPlayer(owner);
            skull.setItemMeta(meta);
```

**PDC item factory pattern (best match for tagged head items):**  
`D:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\Plugin Building\Minecraft\plugins\root-appreciation\src\main\java\com\rootrecord\minecraft\rootappreciation\AppreciationTokenItem.java`

```25:56:D:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\Plugin Building\Minecraft\plugins\root-appreciation\src\main\java\com\rootrecord\minecraft\rootappreciation\AppreciationTokenItem.java
    public AppreciationTokenItem(JavaPlugin plugin) {
        this.tokenKey = new NamespacedKey(plugin, "appreciation_token");
        this.issueIdKey = new NamespacedKey(plugin, "appreciation_issue_id");
    }

    public ItemStack create(AppreciationConfig config, int amount, String issueId) {
        ItemStack stack = new ItemStack(config.tokenMaterial(), ...);
        ItemMeta meta = stack.getItemMeta();
        meta.displayName(...);
        meta.lore(...);
        meta.getPersistentDataContainer().set(tokenKey, PersistentDataType.BYTE, (byte) 1);
        meta.getPersistentDataContainer().set(issueIdKey, PersistentDataType.STRING, issueId);
        stack.setItemMeta(meta);
        return stack;
    }
```

Same PDC read/write pattern:  
`D:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\Plugin Building\Minecraft\plugins\root-memberships\src\main\java\com\rootrecord\minecraft\rootmemberships\ProVoucherItem.java`

**Inspect held item via PDC:**  
`D:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\Plugin Building\Minecraft\plugins\root-appreciation\src\main\java\com\rootrecord\minecraft\rootappreciation\AppreciationTokenListener.java` — `getItemInMainHand()` + `tokens().isAppreciationToken(stack)`.

For custom textures you’ll likely combine `SkullMeta` + Paper `PlayerProfile`/`PlayerTextures` with the base64 from `root-heads.yml` — that code still needs to be written in `HeadItemFactory`.

