### 6. Release / changelog / manifest (not `PLUGIN_RELEASES`)

There is no symbol named `PLUGIN_RELEASES`. Heartbeat + web manifest use **`heartbeatManifestPluginNames`** in  
`D:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\Plugin Building\Minecraft\build.gradle.kts` (includes `"root-heads"` at line 260).

Manifest generation:

```452:476:D:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\Plugin Building\Minecraft\build.gradle.kts
tasks.register("generatePluginManifest") {
    // ...
    for (name in heartbeatManifestPluginNames) {
        manifest[name] = mapOf(
            "version" to version,
            "filename" to filename,
            "url" to "$pluginPublishBaseUrl/$filename",
        )
    }
}
```

Output: `D:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\Web Files\rootmc-web\public\plugins\manifest.json`

